      "title": "Bare Hands for Love",
      "start_block": "B002",
      "end_block": "B013",
      "hook": "Blood-streaked hand uncurling in razor thorns to reveal a ring, with the command 'Now release my husband.'",
      "cliffhanger": "The moment Alexander's shackles fall away and he lunges toward her.",
      "why": "Starts immediately with visceral injury and a high-stakes ultimatum, resolving only to pivot instantly to the emotional reunion.",
      "context_gap": "None; the visual of the ring and the demand clearly establish the stakes."
    },
    {
      "title": "The Duke's Vow",
      "start_block": "B014",
      "end_block": "B051",
      "hook": "Alexander tenderly inspecting Juliana's deep, bleeding gashes with a furious expression.",
      "cliffhanger": "Alexander's knuckles clenching into an iron fist over a bucket of blood-soaked water.",
      "why": "Contrasts intimate tenderness with sudden, terrifying vengeance, ending on a promise of retribution without showing the act.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger might not know who the villains are, but the threat is clear from the bloody water and clenched fist."
    },
    {
      "title": "Never Bleed Again",
      "start_block": "B028",
      "end_block": "B047",
      "hook": "Alexander kneeling by a fire, wrapping bandages around his wife's torn hands while whispering she could have lost them.",
      "cliffhanger": "Alexander's dark vow: 'No one will ever hurt you for protecting me again.'",
      "why": "Uses the emotional intimacy of the healing scene to build tension that snaps into a protective threat at the very end.",
      "context_gap": "None; the relationship and the danger are evident through the dialogue and action."
    }
  ],
  "moments": [
    {
